<title>THAILAND: Thai Danu Bank pays 1.50 baht, H2 div.</title>
<headline>Thai Danu Bank pays 1.50 baht, H2 div.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>    Dividend (baht)	     1.50	 vs     3.00</p>
<p>    Ex-dividend		   March 7, 1997</p>
<p>    Payment date		  April 3, 1997</p>
<p>Note - Full name is Thai Danu Bank Plc, a commercial bank.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662-2529950)</p>
